stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> StageTree: local copy Ahead (or Diverged)
    StageTree --> Abort: re-read digest or hash mismatch
    StageTree --> PublishTree: tmp/HOST/ staged and verified
    PublishTree --> PublishCommit: rename to trees/DIGEST/<br/>(skip if it already exists)
    PublishCommit --> Confirm: commits/ID.json, parents = [B]<br/>(write-once)
    Confirm --> MoveHead: provider reports tree and commit uploaded
    MoveHead --> Reader: heads/HOST.json rewritten LAST<br/>(only this host writes it)
    Abort --> [*]: remove tmp, log ERROR, notify
    Reader --> InFlight: a commit or tree is missing,<br/>or its digest fails
    Reader --> Forked: heads not ancestry-ordered
    Reader --> Usable: one tip all heads descend from = R
    InFlight --> Reader: retry next tick, apply nothing
    Forked --> [*]: ADR 0007, wait for resolve
    Usable --> [*]: continue with ADR 0005
